		"published": "YES",
		"coverType": "PNG",
		"coverCredit": "",
		"coverLink": "",
		"description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>The mystery surrounding Tiffany and Emma is resolved... in a very unexpected way.  My goal in this story was to have Emma do something that would seem very out of character for her real life counterpart.  I have to admit, I accomplished it.  But the way I did it... well, let's just say that, if by some ridiculously slim chance Emma and I end up in the same place at the same time, she would have the right to punch me directly in the face.  And I should be forced to keep my hands at my sides and just take it.</p>",
