		"coverCredit": "",
		"coverLink": "",
		"description": "<p class='indexstorydescription'>RSI's newest addition has gotten past her problems with Richelle and is starting to fit in nicely.  The problem?  There's no one on her level for her to train with.  The only solution is to recruit another rookie to be her training partner.  Only, as usual, Richelle can't keep things simple.  Instead, she embarks on a new experiment.  One that gives her an instant pain in her skull.</p>",
